# The go semantic adapter lever (#11570).
#
# Add one `<issue>-<slug>` line when a change alters the value semantics the
# go lowerer publishes for unchanged source: its identity is hashed into
# every semantic artifact key, every public id derived from the adapter
# fingerprint, the lowered-IR producer epoch and the policy lowering identity.
# No other language's identity moves. Git merges this file with merge=union, so
# two branches that each add a line keep both. Never edit or remove a line;
# compaction replaces a prefix with a checkpoint line and keeps the identity.
# See .agents/docs/cache-identity-levers.md.
#
# Replaced the numbered literal `go-value-semantics-v115`.
